attribution: Words and music by Hughie Cannon (died 1912); published by Howley, Haviland & Dresser, New York, in 1902. The chorus words are those of the 1902 edition, with the dialect spellings written in standard English. Public domain: published before 1931 (United States) and all authors died before 1972 (Canada).
